      "content": "i know there are people to call but it doesn't change the reality. nothing changes. i look at him and i just feel this massive wall of dread. even when he’s sleeping i can't relax because im just waiting for the next crisis. i feel like i'm just existing in this loop of misery and there's no way out. it's like i'm just waiting for something to finally end so i can actually breathe.",
